---
import BaseLayout from "../../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
import Header from "../../components/Header.astro";
import Marquee from "../../components/Marquee.astro";
import CardTop from "../../components/CardTop.astro";
import EmailCompose from "../../components/EmailCompose.astro";
import "../../styles/two-business-owners.css";
---
<BaseLayout
  title="The Two Business Owners | Omar"
  description="Same start. Same skills. One made three times more. A short letter on the one decision that made the difference."
  ogTitle="The Two Business Owners"
  ogDescription="Same start. Same skills. One made three times more. Here's why."
  ogType="article"
  noindex
  fonts="family=Caveat:wght@600&family=Space+Grotesk:wght@400;500;700"
  skipTo={{ href: "#letter", label: "Skip to the letter" }}
>
  <Header slot="header" ctaHref="#email">Email me your 3 things</Header>

  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="hero-title">
    <div class="container hero__grid">
      <div class="hero__copy">
        <p class="eyebrow hero__eyebrow"><span aria-hidden="true">✉</span> A letter to business owners</p>
        <h1 id="hero-title" class="hero__title">The Two <span class="highlight highlight--hero">Business Owners</span></h1>
        <p class="lead hero__lead">Same start. Same skills. One made three times more. Here's why.</p>
        <div class="hero__cta">
          <a class="btn btn--primary btn--lg" href="#letter">Read the letter <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">↓</span></a>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="hero__visual">
        <div class="duo" role="img" aria-label="Two business owners compared. Equal skill and equal happy clients, but owner B makes three times the revenue of owner A.">
          <div class="duo__card duo__a" aria-hidden="true">
            <p class="duo__who"><span class="duo__avatar">A</span> Business owner A</p>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Skill</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill" style="width:90%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">✓</span></div>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Happy clients</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill" style="width:85%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">✓</span></div>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Revenue</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill duo__fill--money" style="width:33%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">1x</span></div>
          </div>
          <div class="duo__card duo__b" aria-hidden="true">
            <span class="sticker duo__sticker">3x more</span>
            <p class="duo__who"><span class="duo__avatar">B</span> Business owner B</p>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Skill</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill" style="width:90%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">✓</span></div>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Happy clients</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill" style="width:85%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">✓</span></div>
            <div class="duo__row"><span>Revenue</span><span class="duo__track"><span class="duo__fill duo__fill--money" style="width:100%"></span></span><span class="duo__val">3x</span></div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <Marquee items={["Same start", "Same skills", "Same city", "Same market", "One decision", "Three times the money"]} />

  <!-- The letter -->
  <section class="section" id="letter" aria-label="The letter">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="ltr">

        <article class="ltr-box" data-reveal>
          <p class="tag">The story</p>
          <p class="ltr-salute">Dear Business Owner,</p>

          <p>In the bleak midwinter, about a year ago, two business owners opened the same kind of business, at the same time, in the same city.</p>

          <p>They were very much alike, these two. Both were skilled at what they did. Both were well liked by their customers. And both, as new business owners usually are, were filled with ambitious dreams of growth.</p>

          <p>Recently, the two met again at an industry event.</p>

          <p>They were still very much alike. Both offered the same service. Both had a long list of happy clients. Both were talented, and both were loved for it.</p>

          <p class="ltr-punch">But there was a difference. One of them was making three times as much money as the other. And the other had no idea, because by his own measure, business was going great.</p>
        </article>

        <section class="ltr-box ltr-box--surface" aria-labelledby="s1" data-reveal>
          <CardTop num="01"><path d="M12 21v-8M12 13L5 6M12 13l7-7M5 6v4M5 6h4M19 6v4M19 6h-4"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s1">What Made The <span class="highlight">Difference</span></h2>

          <p>Have you ever wondered, as I have, what makes this kind of difference between two people? It isn't raw intelligence, talent, or even hard work. It isn't that one wants success and the other doesn't.</p>

          <p class="ltr-pull">The difference lies in the decisions each one made, and how they made them. One decision above all: who they trusted to help them grow.</p>

          <p>That is why I am writing to you, and to business owners like you. Because the people you bring into your business will either move it forward or keep it exactly where it is.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="ltr-box" aria-labelledby="s2" data-reveal>
          <CardTop num="02" slate><circle cx="10.5" cy="10.5" r="6.5"/><path d="M15.5 15.5L21 21"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s2">A Strategic Marketer <span class="highlight">Unlike Any Other</span></h2>

          <p>You see, the right strategic marketer is rare. Before he ever sends you a message, he has already studied your niche. He knows who your customers are, what makes them buy, and what makes them walk away.</p>

          <p>He studies what the top players in your market are doing, which campaigns are working for them, and where the gaps are. And he does not reach out to a single business owner until he has found a specific problem in that business that he knows how to fix. A problem that, once fixed, brings in more clients.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="ltr-box ltr-box--mist" aria-labelledby="s3" data-reveal>
          <CardTop num="03"><rect x="3" y="3" width="18" height="18"/><path d="M7 12l3 3 7-7"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s3">The Right Decision <span class="highlight">Is Key</span></h2>

          <p>Deciding whether to hire a marketer is a big decision. Knowing how to choose the right one is an even bigger one.</p>

          <p>A great strategic marketer doesn't guess what you or your customers want. He knows it before the first call. He knows the problem he's going to solve before you've even described it.</p>

          <p>Why? Because a good marketer will never waste your time, or his own, pitching a business he isn't sure he can help. Only marketers chasing a quick paycheck do that. The real ones do this work because they enjoy watching a business grow and its owner succeed.</p>

          <p class="ltr-pull">If you have never worked with a strategic marketer like this, you cannot imagine how useful one can be to you.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="ltr-box" aria-labelledby="s4" data-reveal>
          <span class="sticker ltr-sticker" aria-hidden="true">Free call</span>
          <CardTop num="04" slate><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s4">A Time and Money <span class="highlight">Saving Offer</span></h2>

          <p>Put my words to the test with a free 15 minute call. Before we book it, I'll need three things from you:</p>

          <ol class="ltr-steps">
            <li>Your niche</li>
            <li>Your website</li>
            <li>A few lines on how business has been this past month. Nothing long, just an honest snapshot.</li>
          </ol>

          <p>I don't take on every business owner who reaches out. I research your business and your market first, and I only move forward if I find a problem I'm confident I can solve. That way, neither of us wastes a minute.</p>

          <p>Simply click the email button below and send me those three things. Within 24 hours, I'll reply to confirm that my research has begun and we'll schedule our call. By the time we speak, I will have finished studying your business and will come prepared with a clear plan for the problem I found.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="ltr-box ltr-box--sand" aria-labelledby="s5" data-reveal>
          <span class="ltr-stamp" aria-hidden="true">Guaranteed</span>
          <CardTop num="05" slate badgeStyle="background:var(--raised)"><path d="M12 3l8 3v6c0 5-3.5 8-8 9-4.5-1-8-4-8-9V6z"/><path d="M8.5 12l2.5 2.5 4.5-5"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s5">My <span class="highlight">Guarantee</span></h2>

          <p>I won't promise you overnight results. Anyone who does is just selling you something. What I will guarantee is this: if we decide to work together, you will see a real, positive change in your business by the end of our first month.</p>

          <p>About those two business owners I mentioned at the beginning of this letter: they started at the same time, with the same skills, in the same market. So what made their businesses so different?</p>

          <p class="ltr-punch">One decision. Choosing to hire a strategic marketer, and choosing the right one.</p>
        </section>

        <section class="ltr-box" aria-labelledby="s6" data-reveal>
          <CardTop num="06"><path d="M3 17l6-6 4 4 8-8"/><path d="M15 7h6v6"/></CardTop>
          <h2 id="s6">An Investment <span class="highlight">In Success</span></h2>

          <div class="ltr-cases">
            <p class="ltr-case"><strong>Worst case:</strong> we decide we're not the right fit, and you walk away from the call with a few fresh ideas you can use in your business right away.</p>
            <p class="ltr-case ltr-case--best"><strong>Best case:</strong> we work together, and a year from now, you're the business owner making three times as much.</p>
          </div>

          <div class="ltr-sign">
            <p>Sincerely,</p>
            <p class="ltr-sig">Omar</p>
          </div>
        </section>

        <p class="ltr-ps" data-reveal><strong>P.S.</strong> Because I research every business before we ever speak, I can only take on a few new clients at a time. If you'd like to be one of them, click the email button below and send over your niche, your website, and last month's snapshot today.</p>

      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Email CTA -->
  <section class="ltr-cta" id="email" aria-label="Email Omar">
    <div class="container">
      <EmailCompose href="mailto:omaraybak89@gmail.com?subject=Free%2015%20minute%20call&body=Niche%3A%0AWebsite%3A%0ALast%20month%20in%20a%20few%20lines%3A">
        <div slot="draft" class="ltr-template" aria-hidden="true">
        <span>Niche:</span>
        <span>Website:</span>
        <span>Last month:</span>
        </div>
        Email Me Your 3 Things <span class="btn__arrow" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
      </EmailCompose>
    </div>
  </section>

</BaseLayout>
